# GPS-denied flight on the position of a companion computer's visual odometry / SLAM (e.g. the
# real drone's Raspberry Pi: RTAB-Map -> MAVROS vision_pose -> VISION_POSITION_ESTIMATE), sent
# over MAVROS (TCP 5763), as on the real drone. Loaded by: ./run_sitl.sh --gazebo --nav extnav
# Unlike --nav vicon nothing in SITL produces the position: without the companion the EKF has none,
# and the companion also sets the EKF origin (the real drone's vo_to_mavros does).
# Same EKF setup as the real FC (ego_planner_ws/fc_params/CHANGES.md).

# Fly on EKF3. SITL builds default to AHRS_EKF_TYPE 10 (the simulator's perfect state), which
# would ignore the EKF -- and with it the visual odometry -- entirely.
AHRS_EKF_TYPE    3
EK2_ENABLE       0
EK3_ENABLE       1

# No GPS at all
GPS1_TYPE        0
SIM_GPS1_ENABLE  0

# Visual odometry over MAVLink (from MAVROS)
VISO_TYPE        1
# Image -> visual odometry -> MAVROS latency (ms). The real FC: 110 (fc_truf.parm sets it).
VISO_DELAY_MS    80

# EKF3 source set 1: position and yaw from ExtNav, velocity derived (VISION_POSITION_ESTIMATE has
# none), height from ExtNav too, so the EKF frame is the visual odometry's frame.
EK3_SRC1_POSXY   6
EK3_SRC1_VELXY   0
EK3_SRC1_POSZ    6
EK3_SRC1_VELZ    0
EK3_SRC1_YAW     6
